# Workflow Execution — AIOS

Fonte: `.aios-core/development/tasks/` e `.aios-core/development/workflows/`

## Task-First Principle

Workflows são compostos por **tasks conectadas**. A sequência vem de `.aios-core/development/tasks/`.

## 4 Workflows Primários

### 1. Story Development Cycle (SDC)

1. **Create** (@sm): `create-next-story.md` → Draft
2. **Validate** (@po): `validate-next-story.md` → GO (≥7/10) ou NO-GO
3. **Implement** (@dev): `dev-develop-story.md` → Ready → InProgress
4. **QA Gate** (@qa): `qa-gate.md` → PASS/CONCERNS/FAIL/WAIVED → Done

### 2. QA Loop

@qa review → verdict → @dev fixes → re-review (máx 5 iterações)

### 3. Spec Pipeline

Gather (@pm) → Assess (@architect) → Research (@analyst) → Write Spec (@pm) → Critique (@qa) → Plan (@architect)

### 4. Brownfield Discovery

10 fases para avaliação de dívida técnica em codebases existentes.

## Guia de Seleção

| Situação                         | Workflow              |
| -------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Nova story de epic               | Story Development Cycle   |
| QA encontrou issues              | QA Loop                   |
| Feature complexa precisa spec    | Spec Pipeline → depois SDC|
| Entrando em projeto existente    | Brownfield Discovery     |
